    skos:definition 'Any sound other than the sound signal from a specific source, or acoustic and non-acoustic interferences from the measuring device. Applies to a sound pressure signal within the specified frequency band and a time interval specified elsewhere in the data model. The reference level is a pressure of 1 micropascal.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S29::PE001430'^^xsd:string .
